  "aliases": {"en": ["Spanish chicken and rice", "chicken and rice"]},
  "is": "A Spanish family dish of chicken and rice cooked together in one wide pot. The chicken is browned, the rice is stirred through a sofrito of onion, pepper and tomato, and everything cooks in a saffron stock under a lid, so that the rice takes up the flavour of the chicken. Unlike a paella it is cooked covered in a deeper pot, and it has no toasted crust. Peas and a squeeze of lemon are common.",
